      "area_mask": "0x0000400000000094",
      "notes": "Non-Ruins monument. Sets a quest flag when activated. The quest flag depends on which area the object is in:\nMine 2 = 0x2E\nCave 2 = 0x2D\nAny other area = 0x2C\nWhen all three of the above quest flags are active, this object also sets quest flag 0x2F.\nThere appear to be no parameters.",
